# 4. Database Value

All values crossing the actor boundary are value types.

```swift
public enum DatabaseValue:
    Sendable,
    Equatable
{
    case null
    case integer(Int64)
    case real(Double)
    case text(String)
    case blob(Data)
}
```

This prevents SQLite's pointer-backed objects from escaping into the application.

