# 18. Conflict Model

Cloud synchronization should never silently overwrite local state.

```swift
public enum ConflictResolution:
    String,
    Sendable,
    Codable
{
    case localWins
    case remoteWins
    case newestTimestamp
    case merge
    case manual
}
```

The policy should be selected **per record type**, not globally.

