# 27. Better Push Errors

Use this instead in the final implementation:

```swift
public enum PushRuntimeError:
    Error,
    Sendable
{
    case notReady
    case permissionDenied
    case invalidPayload
    case schedulingFailed
    case registrationFailed
    case unsupportedAction
}
```

Then:

```swift
guard
    state == .ready ||
    state == .registered
else {
    throw PushRuntimeError.notReady
}
```

