# 28. Power Integration

The #3 governor remains authoritative for application-level workload policy.

```text
                  #3 POWER
                     │
        ┌────────────┼─────────────┐
        ▼            ▼             ▼
     normal       low power      thermal
        │            │             │
        ▼            ▼             ▼
    full work    reduced work    defer
```

Example:

