# 40. Full iPhone Runtime — Current State

```text
#1   Performance Runtime
        │
#2   Memory Management
        │
#3   Battery & Thermal
        │
#4   Networking & Connectivity
        │
#5   Persistent Storage
        │
#6   UI & Rendering
        │
#7   Security & Privacy
        │
