            timestamp
    }
}
```

The widget should read a small, precomputed snapshot rather than execute the entire #1–#18 runtime.

```text
#15 Database
      │
      ▼
small shared snapshot
      │
      ▼
Widget Extension
      │
      ▼
WidgetKit
```

