# 15. App Intent Boundary

App Intents should expose small, explicit application operations.

```swift
public struct ExtensionIntentRequest:
    Sendable,
    Codable
{
    public let command:
        ExtensionCommand

    public let parameters:
        [String: String]

    public init(
        command:
            ExtensionCommand,
        parameters:
            [String: String] = [:]
    ) {
        self.command =
            command

        self.parameters =
            parameters
    }
}
```

Do not allow an App Intent to invoke arbitrary internal runtime methods.

Instead:

```text
App Intent
    │
    ▼
Validated command
    │
    ▼
Application service
    │
    ▼
#15 / #16 / #17
```

