# 25. Extension Security Boundary

The security architecture is:

```text
                 #7 SECURITY
                     │
       ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
       ▼             ▼             ▼
   Main App       Extension      Shared Data
       │             │             │
       └─────────────┼─────────────┘
                     ▼
              Access Control
```

Never assume:

```text
"extension == trusted main process"
```

Validate all shared input.

Do not place:

```text
passwords
private keys
APNs credentials
OAuth client secrets
session secrets
```

in shared extension files.

