# 32. App Group Database Architecture

The clean production architecture is:

```text
                    #15 DATABASE
                         │
              ┌──────────┴──────────┐
              │                     │
              ▼                     ▼
          MAIN APP              APP GROUP
              │                     │
              │              compact shared state
              │                     │
              │          ┌──────────┼─────────┐
              │          ▼          ▼         ▼
              │       Widget     Intent     Share
              │
