# 33. Extension-Safe Database API

Define a deliberately small read model:

```swift
public protocol ExtensionReadableState:
    Sendable
{
    associatedtype Value:
        Sendable

    func value()
        async throws
        -> Value
}
```

This allows:

```text
Widget
  ↓
WidgetStateProvider

App Intent
  ↓
IntentStateProvider

Share
  ↓
ShareStateProvider
```

rather than:

```text
Widget → entire DatabaseEngine
```

