# 34. Background Integration

Extensions can request work, but #18 owns background execution.

```text
Extension
    │
    ▼
request
    │
    ▼
#18 Background Engine
    │
    ▼
bounded work
```

An extension must not attempt to construct its own permanent background scheduler.

