# 36. Cloud Integration

```text
#16 Cloud
     │
     ▼
database updated
     │
     ▼
shared snapshot regenerated
     │
     ├──────► Widget
     │
     ├──────► Live Activity
     │
     └──────► App Intent
```

Cloud synchronization should happen in the main application/background runtime, not independently in every extension.

---

# 37. Performance Rules

Extension code should follow these rules:

```text
1. Load only required state.
2. Avoid large allocations.
3. Avoid synchronous network requests.
4. Avoid rebuilding the main runtime.
5. Avoid expensive model loading.
6. Avoid persistent polling.
7. Check cancellation.
8. Write atomically.
9. Keep shared state compact.
10. Exit quickly.
```

