# 35. Multiple Windows

The architecture supports:

```text
Window 1
Window 2
Window 3
Window 4
```

with:

```text
Window ID
    │
    ├── lifecycle
    ├── restoration
    ├── navigation state
    ├── workload
    └── priority
```

Application-wide services remain shared.

