The relationship between #4 and #21 is:

```text
#21 Advanced Connectivity
        │
        ├── path
        ├── interface
        ├── local services
        ├── peer connectivity
        ├── route
        └── policy
                │
                ▼
        #4 Networking Runtime
                │
        ┌───────┼────────┐
        ▼       ▼        ▼
      URLSession  Cache  Offline Queue
```

#21 should **not** create a second HTTP client.

