# 32. #16 Cloud Integration

Cloud operations should consume connectivity policy rather than assuming continuous connectivity.

```text
#21
 │
 ├── Wi-Fi available
 │
 ▼
#16 Cloud Sync
 │
 ▼
sync now

#21
 │
 ├── cellular + expensive
 │
 ▼
#16 Cloud Sync
 │
 ▼
defer low-priority sync
```

Critical cloud operations can use a different policy.

