# 33. #18 Background Integration

```text
BACKGROUND
    │
    ▼
#18 Background Runtime
    │
    ▼
#21 Connectivity Policy
    │
    ├── permitted → execute
    └── unsuitable → defer
```

Neither runtime assumes that iOS will grant background execution indefinitely.

