# 23. Tool Execution Policy

```swift
public actor AIToolPolicy {

    public init() {}

    public func mayExecute(
        _ descriptor:
            AIToolDescriptor,
        requiresConfirmation:
            Bool
    )
        -> Bool
    {
        switch descriptor.permission {

        case .readOnly:
            return true

        case .userConfirmed:
            return requiresConfirmation

        case .trusted:
            return true

        case .prohibited:
            return false
        }
    }
}
```

For destructive operations:

```text
AI
 │
 ▼
Tool proposal
 │
 ▼
Policy
 │
 ▼
User confirmation
 │
 ▼
Application action
```

Never:

```text
AI → delete data
AI → transfer money
AI → send message
AI → purchase
```

without the appropriate application authorization boundary.

