# 32. Power Integration

#3 should be allowed to influence the AI governor.

```swift
public enum AIPowerMode:
    String,
    Sendable,
    Codable
{
    case unrestricted
    case balanced
    case lowPower
    case thermalConstrained
}
```

```swift
public actor AIPowerPolicy {

    public init() {}

    public func maximumConcurrency(
        mode:
            AIPowerMode
    )
        -> Int
    {
        switch mode {

        case .unrestricted:
            return 4

        case .balanced:
            return 2

        case .lowPower:
            return 1

        case .thermalConstrained:
            return 1
        }
    }
}
```

These are application concurrency limits, not hardware frequency controls.

