# 4. Coordinate Validation

```swift
public enum GeoCoordinateValidator {

    public static func isValid(
        _ coordinate:
            GeoCoordinate
    )
        -> Bool
    {
        (-90.0...90.0)
            .contains(
                coordinate.latitude
            )
        &&
        (-180.0...180.0)
            .contains(
                coordinate.longitude
            )
        &&
        coordinate.latitude
            .isFinite
        &&
        coordinate.longitude
            .isFinite
    }
}
```

Never allow invalid geographic coordinates into the routing layer.

