**#24 therefore becomes the geographic operating layer for the entire iPhone runtime**: Core Location supplies observations, MapKit supplies maps/search/routing, the geospatial engine supplies application-level computation, #3 controls energy policy, #15 persists durable geographic data, #16 synchronizes it when appropriate, #20 manages map state per scene, and #23 can consume geographic information through tightly controlled AI tools.




# iPhone #25 — Search & Indexing Runtime — Swift

## 1. Purpose

```text
                         #10 MASTER RUNTIME
