        ▼                       ▼                       ▼
     #15 DATA                #24 GEO                  #23 AI
     DATABASE               GEOSPATIAL             INTELLIGENCE
        │                       │                       │
        └───────────────────────┼───────────────────────┘
                                ▼
                       INDEX + RANK + QUERY
                                │
             ┌──────────────────┼──────────────────┐
             ▼                  ▼                  ▼
          #16 CLOUD          #19 EXTENSIONS      #20 SCENES
```

#25 provides:

* local application search
* full-text indexing
* tokenisation
* prefix search
* exact matching
* relevance scoring
* filtering
* sorting
* geographic filtering
* recency ranking
* search suggestions
* index maintenance
* incremental indexing
* deletion handling
* persistence
* cancellation
* bounded result sets
* diagnostics
* AI-assisted semantic search integration
* UI search state

The runtime deliberately separates **indexing** from **searching**.

