# 25. Search Cancellation

Search should be cancellable.

```swift
public enum SearchCancellation {

    public static func check()
        throws
    {
        if Task.isCancelled {
            throw GeoRuntimeError
                .cancelled
        }
    }
}
```

For #25, a dedicated search cancellation error is preferable:

```swift
public enum SearchRuntimeError:
    Error,
    Sendable
{
    case cancelled
    case indexUnavailable
    case invalidQuery
    case persistenceFailure
}
```

