# 31. iCloud Document Boundary

The #16 Cloud Runtime and #26 File Runtime have different responsibilities.

```text
#26 FILE RUNTIME
    │
    ├── local documents
    ├── file coordination
    ├── document URLs
    ├── imports/exports
    └── iCloud document files
              │
              ▼
        #16 CLOUD RUNTIME
              │
              ├── CloudKit records
              ├── sync state
              └── remote metadata
```

CloudKit records and iCloud document files should not be treated as identical storage mechanisms.

