# 8. Adaptive Thermal Action

```swift
public enum ThermalAction:
    String,
    Codable,
    Sendable
{
    case maintain
    case reduceFrequency
    case reduceQuality
    case reduceConcurrency
    case deferBackgroundWork
    case pauseOptionalWork
    case emergencyStopOptionalWork
}
```

The actions refer to **application behaviour**.

For example:

```text
reduceQuality
    ↓
camera 4K → 1080p

reduceConcurrency
    ↓
4 AI requests → 1 AI request

deferBackgroundWork
    ↓
search indexing → later

reduceFrequency
    ↓
polling interval increases
```

They do not mean that the application directly changes hardware clock frequency.

