# 26. AI Integration

#23 can use the same prediction.

```swift
public struct AIThermalPolicy:
    Sendable
{
    public init() {}

    public func concurrency(
        forecast:
            ThermalForecast
    )
        -> Int
    {
        switch forecast
            .recommendedAction
        {
        case .maintain:
            return 4

        case .reduceFrequency,
             .reduceQuality:
            return 2

        case .reduceConcurrency:
            return 1

        case .deferBackgroundWork,
             .pauseOptionalWork,
             .emergencyStopOptionalWork:
            return 0
        }
    }
}
```

Thus a sustained local AI workload can gracefully reduce concurrency rather than waiting for the operating system to become thermally constrained.

