# 34. Recommended Diagnostic Policy

```text
FOREGROUND / INTERACTIVE
        │
        ▼
 lightweight checks
 frequent heartbeat
 strict latency monitoring

BACKGROUND
        │
        ▼
 reduced diagnostic frequency
 batch verification

LOW POWER MODE
        │
        ▼
 minimum diagnostics
 no unnecessary scans

THERMAL PRESSURE
        │
        ▼
 diagnostics become cheaper
 nonessential checks deferred

CRITICAL FAILURE
        │
        ▼
 targeted diagnostics only
 preserve evidence
 avoid diagnostic storm
```

