# 35. Diagnostic Storm Protection

Repeated failures should not generate thousands of identical events.

```swift
public actor DiagnosticDeduplicator {

    private var lastEmission:
        [String: Date] = [:]

    private let suppression:
        TimeInterval

    public init(
        suppression:
            TimeInterval = 30
    ) {
        self.suppression =
            suppression
    }

    public func shouldEmit(
        code:
            String
    )
        -> Bool
    {
        let now =
            Date()

        if let last =
            lastEmission[code],
           now.timeIntervalSince(
                last
           ) < suppression
        {
            return false
        }

        lastEmission[code] =
            now

        return true
    }
}
```

This is particularly important for:

```text
network unavailable
cloud unavailable
thermal pressure
database retry
watchdog timeout
camera interruption
```

