# 38. Regression Baselines

#30 can consume the baselines from #29.

```swift
public struct PerformanceBaseline:
    Codable,
    Sendable
{
    public let operation:
        String

    public let expectedMilliseconds:
        Double

    public let p95Milliseconds:
        Double

    public let p99Milliseconds:
        Double

    public init(
        operation:
            String,
        expectedMilliseconds:
            Double,
        p95Milliseconds:
            Double,
        p99Milliseconds:
            Double
    ) {
        self.operation =
            operation

        self.expectedMilliseconds =
            expectedMilliseconds

        self.p95Milliseconds =
            p95Milliseconds

        self.p99Milliseconds =
            p99Milliseconds
    }
}
```

A release candidate can then be evaluated using:

```text
operation
   │
   ├── average
   ├── p95
   ├── p99
   ├── failure rate
   └── cancellation rate
```

rather than relying only on average latency.

