# 39. Cancellation Telemetry

Cancellation is an important signal in a structured-concurrency system.

```swift
public struct CancellationTelemetry:
    Sendable
{
    public init() {}

    public func cancelled(
        subsystem:
            InstrumentationDomain
    )
        async
    {
        await InstrumentationRuntime
            .shared
            .increment(
                MetricIdentifier(
                    "tasks.cancelled"
                ),
                domain:
                    subsystem
            )
    }
}
```

A sudden increase in cancellation can indicate:

```text
timeout
backpressure
scene disappearance
thermal policy
user cancellation
background transition
dependency failure
```

The reason should be explicitly recorded where known.

