# 50. Runtime Instrumentation Policy

```text
                         #30
                          │
              ┌───────────┴───────────┐
              │                       │
          DEVELOPMENT               RELEASE
              │                       │
              ▼                       ▼
         rich tracing             low overhead
         histograms               important metrics
         timelines                selected signposts
         regression               bounded storage
         debugging
```

The runtime must never assume that more telemetry is always better.

